<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela is coping with severe earthquake damage to buildings, creating urgent humanitarian needs, while the United States has lifted sanctions on the National Assembly leader and deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against the country. President Maduro and his wife face a delayed U.S. torture conspiracy trial scheduled for 2027, and the Trump administration is planning changes to Delcy Rodríguez's government and Venezuela's oil industry. A Dutch security report warns that Venezuela's instability could threaten Curaçao and the wider Caribbean Kingdom, and workers are demanding real wage recovery as the government weighs labor proposals. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOU0VYTGZPd2RmZlZvZWJBZmRHbEsxWFdtYXF3b1ZJVU9FZmRncmoxSERRWldzS0Z0TTJsbVRoLThDT2FfZi1XVHB2QkhmemJGX0M2S3RsUVBTSnN1engtaURsamc3TGxRa0E2RmpVaEJOdVFCQlVhaDJWaG5qQzVCNkRYckxRMmdOZElvLU1zZjROb1p2X1AxYUVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPSThkVlA4a1BiZmExS0k4djM2cmEwaXliX2k5eUFnLU9qM2x6X0llMkU5QjhiNWxZLVI0SzF6Ykc5aEVVTTFydjF4MzgtVHJPRU10V2tFM0prSWRDVWJiU2pUaFNlLWo0eGd3dmtwNjFZYk1HLUVreW1rMzhKUDZ2Wm9FNzFFVnZGVE51REU1aWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNMWpya25lX28tcGJpZ0MxbzZHWXFUNko5a1puYi1lZTFvOXBET1NjTHRoR0xKaVJYN0JJd0tCOWJ2U3pWR0lNVGpmbFBRRW8xUFluaWhoUnM5Qm56dlM5dWVTQVdXZzZiNlFod0oxQk1Bb1RIZjhmaWJFaFBvdzh1TWdlenBNcGxfWlVKLTNZa3JYUVhnUXhoU1N3bDJXeURoSmpBLVc1ZFNNc3VscnV4Vk51aVhmaXdncjAyV3B3emwyczJmejQxZC13?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&